WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.730
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.540
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:34.590
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.680
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.600
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.730
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.940
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:57.200
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.620
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.620
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:09.380
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.380
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.630
I trust you forever

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:32.150
Wh-what's the matter,
Allenby?!

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:41.240
Graham!

00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:43.450
Allenby!

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:50.250
Now...

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:53.170
Something really incredible
has happened.

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:54.960
Two tag teams...

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:57.800
...brought Argo and Graham
against Domon and Allenby.

00:01:57.800 --> 00:01:59.430
But the match ended in chaos...

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:02.220
...as a result of Wong's
sinister plan.

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:08.230
And what about the rift growing
between Wong and Master Asia?

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:10.980
The problem seems like it's
going to blow up at any time.

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:14.190
What will happen to the bond
between these two men?

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:15.320
And now!

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:20.150
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:20.150 --> 00:02:26.200
The Ultimate Attack!
Duel With Master Asia

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:35.630
Allenby!

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:37.460
Allenby!

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:39.840
What? What's going on?

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:45.890
Domon...

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:48.350
I'm all right.

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:49.100
However...

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:53.100
The Berserker System did this?

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:54.860
It appears so.

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:56.230
Domon!

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:57.780
Give me a hand.

00:02:58.070 --> 00:02:58.990
I'll be right there!

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:01.570
Rain! Take care of Allenby!

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:02.570
Right!

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:03.610
Leave her to me!

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:09.290
The medical team.

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:16.750
Excuse me...

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:19.340
Um, I'm going with you.

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:21.300
There'll be no need for that.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:23.550
I happen to be a doctor.

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:26.300
Let us handle the situation.

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:27.760
Okay, let's hurry!

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:28.830
Wait a minute.

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:29.810
What about Graham?

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:31.770
Another team's on the way.

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:48.450
What's the big idea?

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:53.580
You almost ended up
killing Domon.

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:57.790
Our main objective has been to
determine the strongest Fighter.

00:03:57.790 --> 00:03:59.590
If Domon is defeated...

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:04.380
...then we simply shift our focus
to the Fighter who beat him, right?

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:08.720
You're saying you understand
what true strength is, Wong?

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:12.520
You've been pushing for
Domon more than necessary.

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:15.940
I guess ties between teacher
and pupil are hard to sever.

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:16.980
Garbage.

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:19.190
He and I are sworn enemies.

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:20.230
Well, then...

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:22.360
...I'm sure you won't
have a problem...

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:24.900
...with the final match-up
I've arranged for him.

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:32.620
This Gundam Fighter and
Domon are both undefeated.

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:36.500
They've already secured
a spot in the Battle Royale.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:38.000
Why have them fight now?

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:40.210
That's what makes this
more interesting.

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:44.920
But if Schwarz is who
I think he is...

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:49.760
If I'm not mistaken...

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:53.220
...then Domon has no
chance of winning now.

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:57.510
<i>Dr. Chen, operating room</i>.

00:04:57.510 --> 00:04:59.860
<i>Dr. Chen, operating room</i>.

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:02.230
Graham's operation went well.

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:05.400
But he'll never be strong enough
to be a Fighter.

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:07.160
I see.

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:07.990
Domon.

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:10.830
Which room is Allenby in?

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.950
They told me she wasn't
brought to this hospital.

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:14.950
What's that?

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:16.960
What do you mean?!

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:18.920
Domon Kasshu!

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:20.790
Why, you!

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:23.950
Why did you activate the
Berserker System on Allenby?!

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:25.100
N-no...

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:28.010
We weren't the ones
who activated the system!

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.180
What do you mean?

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:35.480
Someone used the same device
to control Allenby.

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:36.680
Are you sure?

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:41.690
Allenby and Dr. Belliman,
the inventor of the system...

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:43.320
...have both gone missing.

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:47.610
The two must have
been kidnapped...

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:49.740
...by whoever activated the system.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:51.620
Kidnapped?

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:55.160
Wh-what's going on, Rain?!

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:56.160
Huh?

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:59.250
I left Allenby with you!

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:02.000
So why weren't you with her
the whole time?!

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.340
Why did you let her
out of your sight?!

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:05.460
Why?!

00:06:13.550 --> 00:06:16.890
Didn't you check to see
if the medical team was real?!

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:18.890
Answer me, Rain!

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:21.100
They looked like the real thing?

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:23.360
And that's why you left her
in their hands?!

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:26.530
You told me before...

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:29.070
...that once you took on a patient,
you stuck by them.

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:31.200
Was that a lie?!

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:36.810
Then you don't deserve
to be a doctor!

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:39.750
You have no right to be in my crew!

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:45.920
Where're you going?!

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:47.010
Back off!

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:50.510
Domon!

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:51.430
Keep out of this!

00:06:51.630 --> 00:06:54.260
I'll look for Allenby by myself!

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:57.180
By myself!

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:03.730
Domon's late getting back.

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:06.900
I wonder if he got lost somewhere.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:11.900
H-he's all right,
because Domon's strong.

00:07:11.900 --> 00:07:14.240
He'll be okay all by himself.

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:16.740
You're right.

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:19.330
You'll do okay by yourself.

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:21.800
Or perhaps you'd be better off
by yourself.

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:24.920
Rain...

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:32.130
Allenby...

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:33.890
Where'd you go?

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:37.510
Who took you away?
And for what reason?

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:41.850
You are...

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:48.070
Fuun Saiki?

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:59.490
What happened to your owner?

00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:01.370
What're you doing out here?

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:10.590
You want me to ride you?

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:24.390
Where exactly are you taking me?

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:56.930
There's no turning back now.

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:20.380
What is this place?

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:30.710
Aren't you coming?

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:34.710
All right, then.

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:36.510
I'll continue on my own.

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:59.530
Never thought I'd see a place
like this near Neo Hong Kong.

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:10.420
Domon!

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:14.630
Undefeated of the East.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.630
So it was you.

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:20.840
Master Asia's established
contact with Domon?

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:23.140
On the island to the northeast.

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:24.680
As I thought.

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:27.020
Send out a Gundam Head.

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:28.520
But Master Asia's there.

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:29.770
Who cares?

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:32.270
Even if that old man escapes...

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:36.480
...he really has no idea that I can
control the Gundam Heads.

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:38.530
It won't be hard to make up a lie.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:43.740
Domon!

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:45.870
Wake up, already!

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:49.370
You didn't notice my presence
until I called your name?!

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:51.250
You lack skill!

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:55.340
You expect you have a chance
against Gundam Spiegel?!

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:57.590
Gundam Spiegel!

00:10:57.590 --> 00:11:00.470
You're saying my
next opponent is Schwarz?!

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:01.800
That's right!

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:06.060
But I'll defeat you before
Schwarz has a shot at you!

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:07.390
What?!

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:11.350
You can't escape!

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:15.270
Domon!

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:17.940
You'll sink in that
bottomless pit of mud!

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:20.490
Why, you!

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:30.780
A Gundam Head!

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:42.090
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:51.930
A Gundam Head!

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:53.850
D-did Wong do this?

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:58.150
Undefeated of the East!

00:11:58.150 --> 00:11:59.690
Is this another one of your tricks?

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:01.070
Don't be stupid!

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:02.820
Who else could've...?!

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:04.660
No, Domon!

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.200
You amateur!

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:13.710
Undefeated of the East!

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:15.080
Keep your guard up!

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:24.930
What's going on?!

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:39.940
Undefeated of the East...

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:41.530
Remember to stay calm.

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:43.190
Long ago...

00:12:43.190 --> 00:12:45.630
...this tunnel was used to connect
the island to the mainland.

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:47.490
Let's go.

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:55.460
What's wrong?

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:58.340
Guess I injured my leg
when I fell.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:01.170
I'm all right.
It's nothing serious.

00:13:01.470 --> 00:13:02.420
More importantly...

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:08.680
...we have no choice
but to climb this.

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:10.100
Undefeated of the East...

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:12.350
Why did you save me back there?

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:16.810
I didn't save you.

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:20.440
I just want to make sure I'm the one
who'll defeat you, not a Gundam Head.

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:21.520
In that case...

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:22.900
Calm down.

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:25.360
If we fought here,
we'd both lose our lives.

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:27.860
You're right.

00:13:27.860 --> 00:13:29.480
We can't afford to sit around here.

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:30.910
Gundam...!

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:32.040
Stop that!

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:35.200
If you call for your Gundam here...

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:37.670
...we'd be crushed by falling rubble.

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:39.790
Didn't you think about that?

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:41.750
What do you suggest we do?

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:44.170
Let's walk to the mainland.

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:46.700
We'll call a truce until we escape.

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:47.630
You agree?

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:49.390
Yeah.

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:54.810
I can't jump on this leg.

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:56.930
Get up there first.

00:13:56.930 --> 00:13:59.310
Then use that to pull me up.

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:02.860
I might leave you behind.

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:06.320
What's so funny?

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:11.950
Hurry up.

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:13.450
What'll you do?

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:16.660
Still dragging your feet, huh?

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:53.040
Master...

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:56.490
...I mean, Undefeated of the East...

00:14:57.200 --> 00:15:00.580
...why is the Devil Gundam after you?

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:02.580
After all, you're on their side,
right?

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:08.260
And what're you planning to do...

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:10.340
...with this Gundam Fight
Final Round?

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:11.130
Move!

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:15.560
Damn! We're trapped now!

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:25.730
Do you remember, Domon?

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:28.400
A similar problem in the past.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:29.990
That's right.

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:33.450
We used the School of the
Undefeated of the East's...

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:36.080
...ultimate secret technique...

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:38.200
...known as...

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:41.460
...Sekiha Tenkyoken!

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:46.790
That's...

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:53.090
I remember.

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:54.430
I remember it.

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:56.930
It was the same then as well.

00:15:57.180 --> 00:16:00.270
This man saved me back then.

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:14.780
During my training...

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:16.870
...I got separated from Master...

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:19.520
...and found myself surrounded
by a pack of wolves.

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:27.170
The wolves terrified me
so much...

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:28.590
...I couldn't do a thing.

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:37.220
Master!

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:38.510
You fool!

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:42.640
A martial artist must never let his
mind wander away from his fists!

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:43.980
Forget that...

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:46.940
...and you'll never master
this Sekiha Tenkyoken...

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:49.520
...even in your dreams!

00:16:54.900 --> 00:16:55.990
Master...

00:16:56.950 --> 00:17:00.790
It remains the only technique
that I've never taught you.

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:04.090
You've hardly changed
since I've known you.

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:06.250
You get all worked up...

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:08.920
...disrupting all your feelings...

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:10.800
...and lose sight of
what's most important.

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:14.840
Enough of this small talk.

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:15.590
Let's hurry.

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:22.520
Th-thanks.

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:24.430
No time for small talk, right?

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:25.730
Let's go.

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:32.480
Take a good look, Domon.

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:34.940
Neo Hong Kong...

00:17:34.940 --> 00:17:38.360
...considered to be the most
prosperous city on Earth.

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:41.780
This is the other side of the coin.

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:45.910
Take any place in the world, and
it's headed for certain disaster.

00:17:46.660 --> 00:17:50.920
However, people seem
to ignore this and instead...

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:53.340
...get all excited over
the Gundam Fight.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:57.930
Don't you find human beings to be
detestable creatures beyond hope?

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:01.510
Humans are no longer
needed on Earth.

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:02.970
And that's why...

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:05.390
...and that's why I must...

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:11.190
Not again!

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:12.020
Domon...

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:13.860
You can help me out.

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:18.860
I no longer have the strength to
cast another Sekiha Tenkyoken.

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:23.950
No time!

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:25.200
Hurry now!

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:26.790
We'll break through this
with one strike!

00:18:50.140 --> 00:18:51.270
Are you all right?!

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:54.860
Looks like we somehow survived.

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:58.080
But you must keep your guard up!

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:03.160
The thing beat us here.

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:05.030
Gundam!

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:14.340
There you are, Fuun Saiki!

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:17.010
Be my legs as we fight together!

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:48.080
Nice move!

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:49.250
Stay alert!

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:52.710
Domon! Watch out!

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:55.420
You pests!

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:01.270
Domon!

00:20:01.270 --> 00:20:04.300
Now's the time to try and
use your Sekiha Tenkyoken!

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:18.400
The School of the
Undefeated of the East!

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:24.360
The ultimate technique!

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:27.870
Sekiha Tenkyoken!

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:40.130
I-I did it...!

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:41.800
Domon...

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:46.550
...you've acquired the School of
the Undefeated of the East's...

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:48.550
...Sekiha Tenkyoken.

00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:50.520
The ultimate secret technique.

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:51.770
Master...

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:53.080
With that technique...

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:56.770
...you can fight on an equal footing
against Gundam Spiegel.

00:20:56.770 --> 00:20:57.770
Wait!

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:00.150
I still have questions
I want to ask you!

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:01.190
Now, listen!

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:03.400
Remember the remnants of this city...

00:21:03.670 --> 00:21:05.820
...the final sunset of humanity!

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:07.820
Etch this into your brain!

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:10.460
I'll see you at the Battle Royale!

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.670
Sunset of humanity...

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:24.090
M-Master...

00:21:25.010 --> 00:21:28.170
Master!

00:21:36.730 --> 00:21:38.690
Hurry with the final checks.

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:42.280
Make sure it's ready for use
before Major Ulube returns.

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:43.780
Oh, brother.

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:45.530
We're busy enough with
the God Gundam.

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:47.490
What's that Gundam for, anyway?

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:50.200
Letter of Resignation

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:51.910
What's this?

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:53.160
That's right.

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:54.830
Take this line and...

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:56.500
Dr. Mikamura!

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:58.790
I-it's from your daughter!

00:21:58.790 --> 00:21:59.830
It's from Rain!

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:02.340
Her letter of resignation!

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:05.300
What'd you say?

00:22:24.190 --> 00:22:27.990
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:30.490
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:35.790
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:38.330
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:39.290 --> 00:22:43.460
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:43.460 --> 00:22:47.130
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:47.130 --> 00:22:53.850
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:54.100 --> 00:23:01.400
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:01.690 --> 00:23:05.940
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:06.150 --> 00:23:09.530
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:09.570 --> 00:23:17.000
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:17.000 --> 00:23:25.840
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:33.010 --> 00:23:35.050
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:37.640
A much-anticipated match
in these Finals!

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:40.100
The undefeated Domon
and Schwarz...

00:23:40.100 --> 00:23:43.060
...battle it out in a ring
rigged with explosives!

00:23:43.230 --> 00:23:44.980
And to everyone's surprise...

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:48.940
...Rain shows up as crew
on the Neo Germany Team!

00:23:49.280 --> 00:23:51.530
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:51.530 --> 00:23:55.410
A Ruthless Fight!
Schwarz's Last Match.

00:23:54.030 --> 00:24:00.550
A Ruthless Fight!
Schwarz's Last Match

00:23:55.410 --> 00:23:57.700
Ready! Go!
